1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:02:00,625 --> 00:02:01,985
That was beautiful.

3
00:02:02,065 --> 00:02:03,665
Miss, you played one note incorrectly.

4
00:02:03,745 --> 00:02:04,785
At the seventh passage.

5
00:02:05,585 --> 00:02:06,505
It should have been a brushed stroke,

6
00:02:07,465 --> 00:02:08,385
not a plucked one.

7
00:02:08,465 --> 00:02:10,385
You have an excellent ear, sir.

8
00:02:10,465 --> 00:02:11,785
You even caught such a subtle difference.

9
00:02:12,705 --> 00:02:14,785
Could you play another piece?

10
00:02:14,865 --> 00:02:16,785
-Another one!
-Another one!

11
00:02:16,865 --> 00:02:18,385
Play another one!

12
00:02:18,465 --> 00:02:19,905
Play another one!

13
00:02:33,665 --> 00:02:34,705
Shopkeeper Yan.

14
00:02:34,785 --> 00:02:36,305
When the time comes, you can sit here

15
00:02:36,385 --> 00:02:37,625
and listen to music beneath the moon.

16
00:02:38,905 --> 00:02:39,985
Shopkeeper Yan.

17
00:02:40,065 --> 00:02:41,385
Music can be used like medicine.

18
00:02:41,465 --> 00:02:42,945
The five tones—gong, shang, jue, zhi, and yu—

19
00:02:43,025 --> 00:02:44,105
harmonize with one another

20
00:02:44,185 --> 00:02:45,665
and restore the qi of the five organs.

21
00:02:46,225 --> 00:02:47,985
When a piece ends, illness
recedes and peace returns.

22
00:02:48,065 --> 00:02:49,345
The next time you visit, Shopkeeper Yan,

23
00:02:49,425 --> 00:02:50,585
I would gladly play for you myself

24
00:02:50,665 --> 00:02:52,865
and let you experience five-tone therapy.

25
00:02:53,985 --> 00:02:54,945
All right...

26
00:02:55,025 --> 00:02:56,025
When another opportunity arises,

27
00:02:56,105 --> 00:02:57,945
I will certainly come experience it myself.

28
00:02:58,705 --> 00:02:59,665
Shopkeeper Yan.

29
00:02:59,745 --> 00:03:00,785
This is Huiyin House's

30
00:03:00,865 --> 00:03:02,625
exclusive orange-blossom incense.

31
00:03:02,705 --> 00:03:04,465
It promotes sleep and calms the mind.

32
00:03:04,545 --> 00:03:05,465
Have a smell.

33
00:03:08,425 --> 00:03:10,785
It is the same fragrance Musician Siqi wears.

34
00:03:10,865 --> 00:03:11,985
Then I want it even more.

35
00:03:12,065 --> 00:03:12,945
Very well.

36
00:03:14,225 --> 00:03:15,065
Shopkeeper Yan.

37
00:03:15,145 --> 00:03:16,905
This is Huiyin House's exclusive beauty balm.

38
00:03:18,065 --> 00:03:20,025
-This is Huiyin House's exclusive...
-I'll take them all.

39
00:03:21,465 --> 00:03:23,145
The capital truly is remarkable.

40
00:03:23,225 --> 00:03:24,985
Even listening to music
involves so many refinements.

41
00:03:25,065 --> 00:03:27,545
This has truly opened my eyes.

42
00:03:36,745 --> 00:03:37,585
Gentlemen, please

43
00:03:37,665 --> 00:03:38,825
deliver these to Bofeng House for me.

44
00:03:38,905 --> 00:03:39,745
Yes.

45
00:03:43,985 --> 00:03:46,745
Young Master Shen is truly a charming rake,

46
00:03:46,825 --> 00:03:48,065
wild and uninhibited.

47
00:03:48,145 --> 00:03:50,145
-Who is she?
-In Shazhou, you taught girls to play dice.

48
00:03:50,225 --> 00:03:51,905
In the capital, you drink with noble ladies.

49
00:03:51,985 --> 00:03:53,865
Now you have come to Huiyin
House to flirt again.

50
00:03:53,945 --> 00:03:55,785
Young Master Shen truly is loved by everyone.

51
00:03:55,865 --> 00:03:56,945
Your admirers never end.

52
00:03:59,265 --> 00:04:01,145
Shopkeeper Yan remembers it all so clearly.

53
00:04:01,225 --> 00:04:02,305
Could it be that you care about me?

54
00:04:03,585 --> 00:04:04,425
Lecher.

55
00:04:10,545 --> 00:04:12,985
Shopkeeper Yan changes her
face faster than a page turns.

56
00:04:13,065 --> 00:04:14,505
You only acquired the restaurant yesterday,

57
00:04:14,585 --> 00:04:15,665
and today you already refuse to acknowledge me.

58
00:04:15,745 --> 00:04:17,665
It seems Shopkeeper Yan is
quite lucky in love too.

59
00:04:17,745 --> 00:04:19,465
A beauty on each arm today,

60
00:04:19,545 --> 00:04:20,425
leaving affection wherever you go.

61
00:04:21,345 --> 00:04:23,585
I was gathering ideas for
Bofeng House's opening.

62
00:04:23,665 --> 00:04:25,025
Unlike you.

63
00:04:25,105 --> 00:04:27,065
Wherever you go, you flutter
about like a butterfly,

64
00:04:27,145 --> 00:04:29,545
as though afraid no one
knows what a rake you are.

65
00:04:29,625 --> 00:04:30,625
The feeling is mutual.

66
00:04:31,345 --> 00:04:32,425
I have important business today.

67
00:04:32,505 --> 00:04:33,625
We can talk another day.

68
00:04:33,705 --> 00:04:34,705
Important business?

69
00:04:34,785 --> 00:04:35,825
What important business could you possibly have?

70
00:04:38,425 --> 00:04:39,785
I checked Situ Xue's household register.

71
00:04:39,865 --> 00:04:41,545
She was born to an ordinary family.

72
00:04:41,625 --> 00:04:43,185
After gaining recognition
at the Flower Festival,

73
00:04:43,265 --> 00:04:45,065
she bought Huiyin House with
her earnings from performing.

74
00:04:45,145 --> 00:04:46,425
Since then, she has run it honestly.

75
00:04:46,985 --> 00:04:49,105
Many officials and nobles frequent Huiyin House.

76
00:04:49,185 --> 00:04:50,545
Now the Xiyan flower has appeared here as well.

77
00:04:50,625 --> 00:04:53,345
Whether it is coincidence or
something more remains unknown.

78
00:04:54,145 --> 00:04:55,025
As for the crossbow bolt,

79
00:04:55,105 --> 00:04:56,505
whether it is connected to Beijian

80
00:04:56,585 --> 00:04:57,865
or to the former state of Zhongwan,

81
00:04:57,945 --> 00:04:58,785
we cannot yet draw a conclusion.

82
00:04:59,425 --> 00:05:00,945
Keep watching Huiyin House

83
00:05:01,025 --> 00:05:02,345
and build a good relationship with Situ Xue.

84
00:05:02,425 --> 00:05:03,585
Yes.

85
00:05:40,545 --> 00:05:42,425
The Mystic Bird shall never perish.

86
00:05:42,505 --> 00:05:44,305
The Blood Moon shall endure forever.

87
00:05:44,385 --> 00:05:46,385
Welcome, Mr. Shangguan.

88
00:05:50,625 --> 00:05:52,225
An uninvited guest

89
00:05:52,305 --> 00:05:53,345
visited Huiyin House today.

90
00:05:53,425 --> 00:05:55,145
You truly see the entire board, sir.

91
00:05:55,225 --> 00:05:56,505
He came because of the Xiyan flower.

92
00:05:57,305 --> 00:05:59,785
That dog emperor found
clues at Black Tiger Hall.

93
00:05:59,865 --> 00:06:02,545
Great Ning now closely monitors
every major military camp.

94
00:06:02,625 --> 00:06:04,185
We must find another source

95
00:06:04,265 --> 00:06:05,705
for our weapons.

96
00:06:05,785 --> 00:06:08,305
I have already found a private mine.

97
00:06:08,905 --> 00:06:10,185
Starting immediately,

98
00:06:10,265 --> 00:06:11,465
send men to oversee it day and night

99
00:06:11,545 --> 00:06:12,665
and forge weapons,

100
00:06:12,745 --> 00:06:14,705
so we may soon accomplish

101
00:06:14,785 --> 00:06:16,425
our great plan to restore the kingdom.

102
00:06:16,505 --> 00:06:18,705
But now that the emperor has
grown suspicious of us,

103
00:06:18,785 --> 00:06:20,425
should we kill him first?

104
00:06:20,505 --> 00:06:21,825
If we act rashly now,

105
00:06:21,905 --> 00:06:23,545
we will only alert the enemy.

106
00:06:23,625 --> 00:06:24,465
What I want is...

107
00:06:24,545 --> 00:06:26,825
-a single fatal strike.
-Sir.

108
00:06:26,905 --> 00:06:28,585
I also learned

109
00:06:28,665 --> 00:06:29,785
that at the Great Ning court,

110
00:06:29,865 --> 00:06:31,705
The emperor has established
the Bureau of Intelligence

111
00:06:31,785 --> 00:06:34,065
to weaken the power of both chancellors.

112
00:06:34,145 --> 00:06:36,345
He also promoted the new female
Top Scholar, Meng Tinghui,

113
00:06:36,425 --> 00:06:37,385
to lead the Bureau.

114
00:06:44,105 --> 00:06:45,665
The more chaotic Great Ning's court becomes,

115
00:06:46,265 --> 00:06:47,985
the more favorable the situation is for us.

116
00:06:48,825 --> 00:06:50,785
Find a way to approach Meng Tinghui.

117
00:06:50,865 --> 00:06:52,265
She must be made to serve me.

118
00:06:54,145 --> 00:06:54,985
I obey.

119
00:07:05,865 --> 00:07:07,345
Destroy Great Ning!

120
00:07:07,425 --> 00:07:08,985
Restore Zhongwan!

121
00:07:09,065 --> 00:07:10,505
Destroy Great Ning!

122
00:07:10,585 --> 00:07:12,065
Restore Zhongwan!

123
00:07:12,145 --> 00:07:13,585
Destroy Great Ning!

124
00:07:13,665 --> 00:07:15,465
Restore Zhongwan!

125
00:07:15,545 --> 00:07:16,625
Destroy Great Ning!

126
00:07:16,705 --> 00:07:18,145
Restore Zhongwan!

127
00:07:33,705 --> 00:07:34,785
Official Meng.

128
00:07:34,865 --> 00:07:35,905
I came prepared.

129
00:07:35,985 --> 00:07:36,905
Even ghosts do not frighten me.

130
00:07:37,625 --> 00:07:38,745
I am not afraid of this.

131
00:07:39,465 --> 00:07:40,465
Protect Assistant Shen.

132
00:07:42,065 --> 00:07:42,905
Neither am I.

133
00:07:43,665 --> 00:07:45,065
Assistant Shen,

134
00:07:45,145 --> 00:07:46,985
a delicate woman like you

135
00:07:47,545 --> 00:07:48,745
should remain at home.

136
00:07:49,665 --> 00:07:50,785
If Official Meng can do it,

137
00:07:50,865 --> 00:07:52,065
so can I.

138
00:07:52,145 --> 00:07:53,105
You can have this for free.

139
00:08:03,625 --> 00:08:04,465
Official Meng.

140
00:08:05,105 --> 00:08:05,985
This is the place.

141
00:08:06,785 --> 00:08:08,825
Those corpse thieves have
claimed the hill as their own

142
00:08:09,265 --> 00:08:11,105
and dug up the villagers' ancestral graves.

143
00:08:11,585 --> 00:08:14,185
We must pay to redeem our relatives' remains,

144
00:08:14,265 --> 00:08:16,505
then pay over a hundred taels
each year as a protection fee

145
00:08:16,585 --> 00:08:17,825
just to have a place to bury them.

146
00:08:17,905 --> 00:08:19,345
If we utter a single complaint,

147
00:08:19,425 --> 00:08:21,065
they beat and kick us.

148
00:08:21,145 --> 00:08:23,425
After Grandfather's remains were stolen,

149
00:08:23,505 --> 00:08:25,145
Grandmother was overcome with grief and anger

150
00:08:25,225 --> 00:08:26,305
and passed away as well.

151
00:08:26,385 --> 00:08:27,465
Outrageous!

152
00:08:27,985 --> 00:08:28,865
Right beneath the Son of Heaven's feet,

153
00:08:28,945 --> 00:08:31,065
someone dares commit such inhuman crimes.

154
00:08:31,145 --> 00:08:32,745
We reported them many times,

155
00:08:32,825 --> 00:08:33,785
but the Ministry of Justice ignored us

156
00:08:33,865 --> 00:08:35,825
and dismissed us with all kinds of excuses.

157
00:08:35,905 --> 00:08:38,305
They said it was merely one missing corpse.

158
00:08:38,385 --> 00:08:40,385
They are clearly working together.

159
00:08:41,105 --> 00:08:42,985
Where are those corpse thieves?

160
00:08:43,065 --> 00:08:44,625
I will confront them myself.

161
00:08:45,345 --> 00:08:47,745
They only appear when stealing
corpses or extorting money.

162
00:08:49,025 --> 00:08:50,945
Then we will wait for them
to walk into our trap.

163
00:08:55,025 --> 00:08:55,865
Second Master.

164
00:08:55,945 --> 00:08:57,345
Your foresight is truly remarkable.

165
00:08:58,105 --> 00:09:00,025
You knew they would secretly bury a body,

166
00:09:00,105 --> 00:09:01,785
and sure enough, we found them.

167
00:09:01,865 --> 00:09:03,385
A pack of fools who do not know death is near.

168
00:09:04,465 --> 00:09:06,505
This time, charge them ten
times the ransom. Understood?

169
00:09:07,265 --> 00:09:08,785
My elder brother is far too merciful.

170
00:09:09,505 --> 00:09:11,145
Once I finish this job,

171
00:09:11,225 --> 00:09:12,545
I will ask the gang leader to reward me.

172
00:09:13,225 --> 00:09:15,425
He will certainly let me handle
the gang's business again.

173
00:09:21,185 --> 00:09:22,105
You.

174
00:09:22,185 --> 00:09:23,305
Go see whether there is a new grave over there.

175
00:09:23,385 --> 00:09:24,225
Yes, Second Master.

176
00:09:28,705 --> 00:09:29,625
Seize them! Do not move!

177
00:09:33,505 --> 00:09:34,665
The Divine Guard is here!

178
00:09:34,745 --> 00:09:35,585
Who dares resist?

179
00:09:47,025 --> 00:09:48,345
Put it down.

180
00:09:50,505 --> 00:09:52,105
Lü Er of the Tiger Roar Gang.

181
00:09:52,945 --> 00:09:54,025
It has been a long time.

182
00:09:55,985 --> 00:09:56,825
Lü Er?

183
00:09:57,985 --> 00:09:58,825
Who is that?

184
00:09:58,905 --> 00:10:02,145
I am merely a petty grave robber.

185
00:10:09,785 --> 00:10:10,825
Meng Tinghui.

186
00:10:10,905 --> 00:10:12,185
You are an official of the court,

187
00:10:12,265 --> 00:10:14,145
yet you dare use unlawful
punishment. Is there no law?

188
00:10:14,225 --> 00:10:15,825
So now you recognize me?

189
00:10:15,905 --> 00:10:18,025
You speak to me of unlawful
punishment and the law?

190
00:10:18,105 --> 00:10:19,385
You are not worthy.

191
00:10:20,905 --> 00:10:23,105
If I did not need to keep your wretched life

192
00:10:23,185 --> 00:10:24,185
to investigate the Tiger Roar Gang,

193
00:10:24,265 --> 00:10:26,665
I would cut you into a
thousand pieces right now.

194
00:10:29,465 --> 00:10:30,585
Official Meng.

195
00:10:30,665 --> 00:10:32,545
The law requires conclusive
evidence before conviction.

196
00:10:35,545 --> 00:10:36,625
Take him back to the Bureau.

197
00:10:37,785 --> 00:10:38,945
There are plenty of
instruments of torture there.

198
00:10:39,025 --> 00:10:40,905
We can slowly catch up.

199
00:10:40,985 --> 00:10:42,705
-Take him away.
-Yes.

200
00:10:42,785 --> 00:10:43,625
Move.

201
00:11:01,185 --> 00:11:03,145
By order of Minister Wan
of the Ministry of Justice,

202
00:11:03,225 --> 00:11:05,305
we are here to arrest the corpse thieves.

203
00:11:05,385 --> 00:11:07,025
Official Meng, please hand the prisoners

204
00:11:07,105 --> 00:11:08,425
over to the Ministry of Justice.

205
00:11:08,505 --> 00:11:10,425
The Ministry ignored this case until now,

206
00:11:10,505 --> 00:11:12,385
but the moment my superior arrests someone,

207
00:11:12,465 --> 00:11:13,705
you come running at the scent.

208
00:11:13,785 --> 00:11:15,905
The Capital Prefecture received a report

209
00:11:15,985 --> 00:11:18,345
and transferred the investigation
to the Ministry of Justice.

210
00:11:18,425 --> 00:11:20,145
And if I refuse to surrender them?

211
00:11:20,225 --> 00:11:21,825
We are merely following orders
to collect the prisoners.

212
00:11:21,905 --> 00:11:23,025
If you obstruct us,

213
00:11:23,105 --> 00:11:24,985
do not blame us for being discourteous.

214
00:11:26,185 --> 00:11:27,545
Captain Di.

215
00:11:28,665 --> 00:11:30,185
For obstructing a Ministry investigation,

216
00:11:30,265 --> 00:11:31,545
I can arrest all of you

217
00:11:31,625 --> 00:11:33,385
right now.

218
00:11:33,465 --> 00:11:34,305
Go!

219
00:11:39,385 --> 00:11:40,505
Official Meng.

220
00:11:40,585 --> 00:11:43,065
I truly do not wish to cross
swords with a colleague.

221
00:11:43,145 --> 00:11:45,225
But if you insist on obstructing the law,

222
00:11:45,945 --> 00:11:48,105
Minister Wan's impeachment memorial

223
00:11:48,185 --> 00:11:49,705
will be placed before His Majesty tomorrow.

224
00:11:50,305 --> 00:11:51,185
The Bureau of Intelligence

225
00:11:52,225 --> 00:11:53,785
has the imperial right to
submit memorials directly.

226
00:11:54,465 --> 00:11:56,105
Let us see

227
00:11:56,185 --> 00:11:58,145
whether the Bureau's or the
Ministry's impeachment memorial

228
00:11:58,225 --> 00:11:59,465
reaches His Majesty first.

229
00:11:59,545 --> 00:12:01,705
The Ministry of Justice
oversees all criminal matters.

230
00:12:02,465 --> 00:12:03,905
Even if His Majesty came in person,

231
00:12:03,985 --> 00:12:05,585
proper procedure would still be required.

232
00:12:05,665 --> 00:12:07,065
The Ministry will take

233
00:12:07,145 --> 00:12:08,585
these prisoners today.

234
00:12:08,665 --> 00:12:10,625
Official Meng, I advise you
to recognize the situation.

235
00:12:10,705 --> 00:12:12,825
Otherwise, when Minister Wan arrives himself,

236
00:12:13,465 --> 00:12:15,745
he will not be as easy to reason with as I am.

237
00:12:15,825 --> 00:12:17,465
Official Meng.

238
00:12:17,545 --> 00:12:18,425
Under the Great Ning Code,

239
00:12:18,505 --> 00:12:19,985
cases involving grave crimes

240
00:12:20,065 --> 00:12:21,585
or important suspects

241
00:12:21,665 --> 00:12:23,025
must first be reported by
the Ministry of Justice

242
00:12:23,105 --> 00:12:24,785
and then submitted to His
Majesty for a personal ruling.

243
00:12:24,865 --> 00:12:26,265
This is the court's established procedure.

244
00:12:26,345 --> 00:12:27,665
Official Meng, please reconsider.

245
00:12:27,745 --> 00:12:28,985
Official Meng.

246
00:12:29,065 --> 00:12:31,105
His Majesty established the
Bureau despite great pressure.

247
00:12:31,745 --> 00:12:32,865
It has only just been founded.

248
00:12:33,465 --> 00:12:34,985
This is not the time to make
an enemy of the Ministry.

249
00:12:35,065 --> 00:12:37,585
Official, we had only just set the ambush

250
00:12:37,665 --> 00:12:39,625
when the Ministry's men arrived
in the middle of the night.

251
00:12:40,385 --> 00:12:41,785
There must be something suspicious here.

252
00:12:42,345 --> 00:12:44,105
We should play the long game
and catch the bigger fish.

253
00:12:44,745 --> 00:12:45,905
I will keep watch at the Ministry for you.

254
00:12:50,705 --> 00:12:51,665
Very well.

255
00:12:52,705 --> 00:12:55,265
Today, I will yield one step.

256
00:12:55,345 --> 00:12:56,465
However, what happened here

257
00:12:57,105 --> 00:12:58,945
will be truthfully reported to His Majesty.

258
00:12:59,025 --> 00:13:00,705
Thank you for your cooperation, Official Meng.

259
00:13:02,065 --> 00:13:02,905
Take the prisoners away.

260
00:13:11,625 --> 00:13:12,545
What is that look for?

261
00:13:12,625 --> 00:13:14,065
Are you provoking my superior?

262
00:14:09,305 --> 00:14:10,825
Official Meng.

263
00:14:10,905 --> 00:14:12,825
As you instructed,

264
00:14:12,905 --> 00:14:15,465
we recorded every evil deed

265
00:14:15,545 --> 00:14:16,545
these criminals committed in the village.

266
00:14:23,265 --> 00:14:26,105
These are anonymous petitions
written in blood by the villagers.

267
00:14:26,185 --> 00:14:27,665
They secretly gave them to me as well.

268
00:14:35,505 --> 00:14:37,785
Besides digging up graves, stealing
corpses, and extorting money,

269
00:14:39,225 --> 00:14:41,705
they even dragged a man to death behind a horse.

270
00:14:41,785 --> 00:14:42,985
The Tiger Roar Gang's crimes

271
00:14:43,065 --> 00:14:44,145
are too numerous to record.

272
00:14:44,225 --> 00:14:45,665
Villagers reported them before,

273
00:14:45,745 --> 00:14:47,545
and the Ministry of Justice
handled the case then too.

274
00:14:47,625 --> 00:14:49,305
But they imprisoned the men for only three days

275
00:14:49,385 --> 00:14:51,065
before releasing every one of them.

276
00:14:51,145 --> 00:14:52,385
After that, they became even more brazen.

277
00:14:53,265 --> 00:14:54,105
They set a fire

278
00:14:55,025 --> 00:14:56,825
and burned the villagers
who reported them to death.

279
00:14:57,545 --> 00:14:58,585
After this,

280
00:14:59,745 --> 00:15:02,265
I fear we may be doomed as well.

281
00:15:03,105 --> 00:15:05,585
Minister Wan Kai is a man
of the Left Chancellor.

282
00:15:05,665 --> 00:15:08,105
If the Tiger Roar Gang can truly
come and go freely at the Ministry,

283
00:15:08,185 --> 00:15:09,505
then these waters are far too deep.

284
00:15:09,585 --> 00:15:11,585
I will enter the palace at
once and report to His Majesty.

285
00:15:13,625 --> 00:15:14,545
Official Meng, please

286
00:15:14,625 --> 00:15:16,025
you must save us.

287
00:15:16,105 --> 00:15:17,585
-Thank you, Official Meng.
-Thank you, Official Meng.

288
00:15:17,665 --> 00:15:18,945
-Please rise.
-Thank you, Official Meng.

289
00:15:19,025 --> 00:15:20,145
Get up first. Rise.

290
00:15:26,345 --> 00:15:27,665
Yin Qing sent word.

291
00:15:28,185 --> 00:15:29,025
We will go to the Ministry first.

292
00:15:29,105 --> 00:15:29,945
Zhili.

293
00:15:30,465 --> 00:15:31,865
Summon the Divine Guard.

294
00:15:31,945 --> 00:15:33,425
This time, I will not let him go again.

295
00:15:44,145 --> 00:15:45,025
Official.

296
00:15:45,105 --> 00:15:46,385
They really were released.

297
00:15:49,025 --> 00:15:50,425
Official Meng.

298
00:15:50,505 --> 00:15:51,505
What an honor.

299
00:15:51,585 --> 00:15:52,985
You came to receive us personally.

300
00:15:53,065 --> 00:15:54,465
There is no need.

301
00:15:54,545 --> 00:15:55,785
In prison,

302
00:15:55,865 --> 00:15:57,545
we had our fill of fine wine and meat.

303
00:15:57,625 --> 00:15:59,905
If the Ministry's prison
was too comfortable for you,

304
00:16:00,785 --> 00:16:03,065
then try the prison food at my Bureau.

305
00:16:06,305 --> 00:16:07,985
You little wench.

306
00:16:08,065 --> 00:16:09,745
You really think you are someone important.

307
00:16:15,585 --> 00:16:16,425
Do you still dare report us?

308
00:16:16,505 --> 00:16:17,465
Right beneath the Son of Heaven's feet,

309
00:16:17,545 --> 00:16:19,505
you dare show such contempt for the law?

310
00:16:21,345 --> 00:16:22,185
Stop!

311
00:16:22,265 --> 00:16:23,545
Stop this!

312
00:16:24,385 --> 00:16:25,465
Stop!

313
00:16:26,145 --> 00:16:27,385
We will not report you again.

314
00:16:29,105 --> 00:16:31,145
That little face is rather pretty.

315
00:16:31,225 --> 00:16:32,305
-Let go of me!
-What a pity,

316
00:16:32,385 --> 00:16:33,945
your heart is so vicious.

317
00:16:34,025 --> 00:16:35,585
You made me spend three days in prison.

318
00:16:35,665 --> 00:16:37,505
Should you not compensate me?

319
00:16:42,705 --> 00:16:43,665
Beast!

320
00:16:43,745 --> 00:16:45,265
A-Cheng!

321
00:16:45,345 --> 00:16:46,785
We will not report them again.

322
00:16:46,865 --> 00:16:47,985
We will not.

323
00:16:48,985 --> 00:16:49,825
Get out of the way.

324
00:16:49,905 --> 00:16:50,945
A-Cheng!

325
00:16:51,025 --> 00:16:52,745
I did not see you clearly a few days ago.

326
00:16:53,705 --> 00:16:55,105
But looking closely today,

327
00:16:55,185 --> 00:16:57,185
you truly have a pretty face.

328
00:16:57,265 --> 00:16:58,905
What a waste for you to be an official.

329
00:16:58,985 --> 00:17:00,145
Why not

330
00:17:00,225 --> 00:17:01,745
follow me instead?

331
00:17:03,945 --> 00:17:06,265
Official Meng, you smell wonderful.

332
00:17:09,625 --> 00:17:10,465
A-Cheng!

333
00:17:10,545 --> 00:17:11,945
A-Cheng!

334
00:17:12,785 --> 00:17:13,865
Lü Er.

335
00:17:13,945 --> 00:17:16,465
Today, we will settle both
our old and new grudges.

336
00:17:17,465 --> 00:17:19,025
You stinking wench!

337
00:17:19,105 --> 00:17:21,305
Do not think I fear touching you
merely because you became an official.

338
00:17:21,385 --> 00:17:22,665
Beat them to death!

339
00:17:22,745 --> 00:17:24,505
-Let us see who dares move!
-Stop!

340
00:17:26,225 --> 00:17:27,065
Official Meng.

341
00:17:28,825 --> 00:17:30,105
Lü Er.

342
00:17:30,185 --> 00:17:31,865
Today, I will make you unable to live

343
00:17:31,945 --> 00:17:32,985
and unable to die.

344
00:17:34,425 --> 00:17:35,385
Divine Guard, hear my command.

345
00:17:35,465 --> 00:17:36,745
Seize them.

346
00:17:36,825 --> 00:17:37,745
Yes.

347
00:17:48,385 --> 00:17:49,945
Meng Tinghui!

348
00:17:50,025 --> 00:17:52,145
If you dare touch a single
hair on my head today,

349
00:17:52,225 --> 00:17:54,345
our gang leader will make
your life worse than death.

350
00:17:56,105 --> 00:17:57,185
I only fear he will not dare come.

351
00:17:57,265 --> 00:17:58,505
I would like to see

352
00:17:58,585 --> 00:17:59,865
who is supporting you from behind

353
00:17:59,945 --> 00:18:02,025
and allowing you to act with such impunity.

354
00:18:02,105 --> 00:18:03,545
The man behind him

355
00:18:04,385 --> 00:18:05,385
is someone you cannot afford to provoke.

356
00:18:06,185 --> 00:18:07,825
Just wait for him to punish you.

357
00:18:08,385 --> 00:18:10,185
Today, I will show you clearly

358
00:18:10,905 --> 00:18:14,265
how I use Great Ning's law to punish criminals.

359
00:18:14,345 --> 00:18:15,185
Carry out the sentence.

360
00:18:18,305 --> 00:18:19,785
-Good!
-Good!

361
00:18:19,865 --> 00:18:21,145
Wonderful!

362
00:18:26,425 --> 00:18:27,345
Meng Tinghui!

363
00:18:27,425 --> 00:18:28,545
You stinking wench!

364
00:18:33,665 --> 00:18:36,825
-Good!
-Good!

365
00:18:38,025 --> 00:18:39,265
A female official handles cases

366
00:18:39,345 --> 00:18:42,425
far better than those pompous old officials.

367
00:18:42,505 --> 00:18:44,705
Who knows how many people
these beasts have harmed?

368
00:18:45,385 --> 00:18:46,825
Today, they finally received their retribution.

369
00:18:46,905 --> 00:18:48,265
Yes! Beat him to death!

370
00:18:48,345 --> 00:18:50,225
-Beat him to death!
-Beat him to death!

371
00:18:50,305 --> 00:18:51,745
Release him.

372
00:18:54,585 --> 00:18:56,425
Watch carefully

373
00:18:56,505 --> 00:18:58,465
and see how miserable Lü Er's fate is.

374
00:18:58,545 --> 00:19:01,025
Return and report every
detail to your gang leader.

375
00:19:01,105 --> 00:19:03,185
I, Meng Tinghui, will be
waiting for him at the Bureau.

376
00:19:03,265 --> 00:19:05,585
As long as I remain at the Bureau,

377
00:19:05,665 --> 00:19:08,225
I will uproot the Tiger Roar Gang.

378
00:19:08,305 --> 00:19:09,545
Beat him to death!

379
00:19:10,785 --> 00:19:12,305
I will deliver the message.

380
00:19:12,385 --> 00:19:13,265
Stop!

381
00:19:15,745 --> 00:19:16,905
Meng Tinghui.

382
00:19:17,865 --> 00:19:19,025
For a few petty thieves,

383
00:19:19,105 --> 00:19:20,545
you mobilized so many men.

384
00:19:20,625 --> 00:19:21,465
What are you trying to do?

385
00:19:21,545 --> 00:19:22,585
Continue.

386
00:19:22,665 --> 00:19:24,145
Insolence!

387
00:19:24,785 --> 00:19:25,825
Meng Tinghui,

388
00:19:25,905 --> 00:19:27,225
you dare, in my presence,

389
00:19:27,305 --> 00:19:28,505
publicly cane commoners?

390
00:19:28,585 --> 00:19:30,465
You call them commoners?

391
00:19:30,545 --> 00:19:32,505
They are vicious criminals
receiving what they deserve.

392
00:19:32,585 --> 00:19:34,105
The Tiger Roar Gang also stands behind them.

393
00:19:34,185 --> 00:19:35,825
If I release them today,

394
00:19:35,905 --> 00:19:37,465
-the consequences will be endless.
-Save me!

395
00:19:37,545 --> 00:19:39,385
You are the Minister of Justice,

396
00:19:40,465 --> 00:19:42,545
yet you ignore the people's grievances

397
00:19:42,625 --> 00:19:44,625
and repeatedly obstruct me from punishing evil.

398
00:19:44,705 --> 00:19:46,945
What exactly is your true intention?

399
00:19:47,025 --> 00:19:47,985
Official Meng,

400
00:19:48,065 --> 00:19:50,465
you are merely a sixth-rank official,

401
00:19:50,545 --> 00:19:52,425
yet you wield such grand authority.

402
00:19:52,505 --> 00:19:53,625
These men

403
00:19:53,705 --> 00:19:55,105
merely stole corpses and robbed people.

404
00:19:55,185 --> 00:19:56,745
Why must they be punished in the street?

405
00:19:56,825 --> 00:19:59,145
Today, I will certainly impeach you.

406
00:19:59,225 --> 00:20:03,065
Minister Wan, if your conscience
is clear, then go ahead.

407
00:20:03,145 --> 00:20:04,065
Meng Tinghui!

408
00:20:04,905 --> 00:20:05,745
The gang leader...

409
00:20:06,385 --> 00:20:08,425
will certainly avenge me.

410
00:20:08,505 --> 00:20:09,345
Let him come.

411
00:20:10,225 --> 00:20:11,105
He is precisely the one I am waiting for.

412
00:20:20,345 --> 00:20:21,505
Official, he has fainted.

413
00:20:27,105 --> 00:20:28,865
Well done, Official Meng!

414
00:20:28,945 --> 00:20:31,185
-Yes! Official Meng is a righteous official!
-Yin Qing.

415
00:20:31,265 --> 00:20:33,305
Tie the survivors behind
horses and drag them back.

416
00:20:33,385 --> 00:20:34,745
Meng Tinghui!

417
00:20:34,825 --> 00:20:36,745
Your methods are utterly cruel.

418
00:20:37,265 --> 00:20:38,865
I will report this to His Majesty immediately

419
00:20:38,945 --> 00:20:40,305
-and have you...
-As you wish.

420
00:20:40,385 --> 00:20:42,745
I merely treated them

421
00:20:43,465 --> 00:20:45,145
exactly as they treated others.

422
00:21:06,985 --> 00:21:09,025
Mother, try this breakfast from Fangzhuan House.

423
00:21:09,105 --> 00:21:10,225
It just came out of the kitchen.

424
00:21:15,465 --> 00:21:17,105
You certainly have a fine appetite.

425
00:21:18,025 --> 00:21:19,985
Meng Tinghui publicly caned
a corpse thief to death.

426
00:21:20,065 --> 00:21:21,545
The matter has shaken both
the court and the public.

427
00:21:22,745 --> 00:21:24,385
You are one of His Majesty's close ministers.

428
00:21:24,465 --> 00:21:25,385
Will you not read about it?

429
00:21:25,465 --> 00:21:26,625
Father.

430
00:21:26,705 --> 00:21:27,985
Food is the people's first necessity.

431
00:21:28,465 --> 00:21:29,945
Only after eating can one have strength to work.

432
00:21:30,505 --> 00:21:31,385
Besides,

433
00:21:31,465 --> 00:21:33,025
His Majesty is furious right now.

434
00:21:33,105 --> 00:21:34,785
I would not dare provoke him.

435
00:21:35,905 --> 00:21:37,785
By the way, I heard

436
00:21:37,865 --> 00:21:39,865
the officials' memorials impeaching Meng Tinghui

437
00:21:39,945 --> 00:21:41,185
are already piled taller than a person.

438
00:21:41,905 --> 00:21:44,145
They are all begging His
Majesty to punish her severely.

439
00:21:44,225 --> 00:21:45,825
She has caused such enormous trouble this time

440
00:21:45,905 --> 00:21:47,625
that I cannot imagine how
furious His Majesty is.

441
00:21:47,705 --> 00:21:49,705
The Bureau was already at
the center of controversy,

442
00:21:49,785 --> 00:21:51,225
and Meng Tinghui's way of doing things

443
00:21:51,305 --> 00:21:53,345
differs from that of rigid,
rule-bound officials.

444
00:21:53,425 --> 00:21:54,585
Conflict was inevitable.

445
00:21:55,465 --> 00:21:56,825
The future of the Bureau His Majesty envisioned

446
00:21:56,905 --> 00:21:58,225
and the path it ultimately takes

447
00:21:58,905 --> 00:22:01,225
will depend on how both sides
contend with each other.

448
00:22:05,785 --> 00:22:07,025
You father and son

449
00:22:07,105 --> 00:22:09,025
truly are not worried at all?

450
00:22:09,105 --> 00:22:11,025
This matter now involves Zhili.

451
00:22:11,105 --> 00:22:13,025
When she heard His Majesty
had gone to the Bureau,

452
00:22:13,105 --> 00:22:14,785
she rushed there without even eating breakfast.

453
00:22:14,865 --> 00:22:17,185
A-Nian indulges Zhili far too much.

454
00:22:17,865 --> 00:22:18,985
She went to a cemetery

455
00:22:19,065 --> 00:22:20,145
in the middle of the night.

456
00:22:20,225 --> 00:22:21,305
She grows bolder by the day.

457
00:22:21,905 --> 00:22:24,185
Father, is she not more rebellious than I am?

458
00:22:24,265 --> 00:22:26,465
-I am the obedient one.
-A-Nian at least knows to protect her.

459
00:22:26,545 --> 00:22:27,505
You are her own elder brother,

460
00:22:27,585 --> 00:22:28,905
yet you do not care at all?

461
00:22:29,905 --> 00:22:31,585
You only know how to sit here and eat.

462
00:22:31,665 --> 00:22:33,425
Zhili was clearly the one who broke the rules,

463
00:22:34,305 --> 00:22:35,425
not me.

464
00:22:36,065 --> 00:22:37,025
Forget it.

465
00:22:37,105 --> 00:22:39,265
Zhili has been sheltered since childhood.

466
00:22:39,345 --> 00:22:41,305
Perhaps after this, she
will finally return home.

467
00:22:41,385 --> 00:22:43,265
Then you truly do not understand your sister.

468
00:22:43,345 --> 00:22:45,345
Zhili may appear gentle,

469
00:22:45,425 --> 00:22:46,625
but deep down,

470
00:22:46,705 --> 00:22:47,785
she refuses to be confined
to the women's quarters.

471
00:22:47,865 --> 00:22:49,825
She defies convention and is extremely stubborn.

472
00:22:50,745 --> 00:22:52,025
Just look at A-Nian.

473
00:22:52,105 --> 00:22:54,145
He came to live with our
family at the age of ten,

474
00:22:54,225 --> 00:22:56,465
and now conducts himself with
such maturity and steadiness.

475
00:22:56,545 --> 00:22:59,585
Not only is he considerate
of your mother and me,

476
00:22:59,665 --> 00:23:01,305
he is even more attentive toward your sister.

477
00:23:01,385 --> 00:23:03,425
And you? You are still eating.

478
00:23:03,505 --> 00:23:04,945
How did this become my fault again?

479
00:23:05,025 --> 00:23:06,905
If I cannot afford to provoke
you, I can at least avoid you.

480
00:23:06,985 --> 00:23:08,065
I am leaving, Mother.

481
00:23:11,905 --> 00:23:13,225
Do not waste it.

482
00:23:13,305 --> 00:23:14,145
I am leaving, Father.

483
00:23:15,825 --> 00:23:17,745
A storm is gathering.

484
00:23:19,065 --> 00:23:20,585
The times are about to change.

485
00:23:33,745 --> 00:23:35,025
Sister Zhili.

486
00:23:35,985 --> 00:23:37,825
A-Nian, why are you here?

487
00:23:37,905 --> 00:23:39,665
I was worried about you. Besides,

488
00:23:39,745 --> 00:23:41,225
the men who carried out the
sentence of death by caning

489
00:23:41,305 --> 00:23:42,465
were all Divine Guards under my command.

490
00:23:45,465 --> 00:23:47,065
His Majesty summoned Official Meng alone.

491
00:23:47,145 --> 00:23:48,145
All irrelevant persons

492
00:23:49,225 --> 00:23:50,105
are forbidden from disturbing them.

493
00:23:50,185 --> 00:23:51,625
Guard Huang.

494
00:23:51,705 --> 00:23:52,745
It has already been the
time of one incense stick.

495
00:23:52,825 --> 00:23:54,385
I am truly worried about my superior.

496
00:24:13,425 --> 00:24:14,945
One man died from his injuries,

497
00:24:15,785 --> 00:24:17,665
and two collapsed on the spot.

498
00:24:19,025 --> 00:24:21,465
You have caused an enormous disaster.

499
00:24:25,385 --> 00:24:26,225
Meng Tinghui.

500
00:24:26,305 --> 00:24:28,345
Who gave you such courage?

501
00:24:31,585 --> 00:24:32,985
Look at this.

502
00:24:33,065 --> 00:24:34,305
In a single day,

503
00:24:34,385 --> 00:24:36,305
this entire stack of memorials
was submitted against you.

504
00:25:13,505 --> 00:25:15,905
Why does Your Majesty listen only
to the officials' one-sided accounts

505
00:25:17,545 --> 00:25:19,105
instead of looking at the people's grievances?

506
00:25:20,105 --> 00:25:20,945
Lü Er and his men

507
00:25:21,025 --> 00:25:22,545
previously coerced the Capital Prefect

508
00:25:22,625 --> 00:25:24,025
and nearly had me killed.

509
00:25:25,225 --> 00:25:26,465
Now they steal corpses and extort money.

510
00:25:27,385 --> 00:25:29,105
They even, before my very eyes,

511
00:25:29,185 --> 00:25:30,065
beat A-Cheng

512
00:25:30,145 --> 00:25:32,185
and publicly humiliated his wife.

513
00:25:32,265 --> 00:25:35,385
Those beasts prey on the people
and bully women and children.

514
00:25:35,465 --> 00:25:36,505
There is no evil they will not commit.

515
00:25:37,865 --> 00:25:39,145
Do they not deserve to die?

516
00:25:39,225 --> 00:25:42,025
The law alone determines life and death.

517
00:25:42,105 --> 00:25:43,705
The written law is lifeless.

518
00:25:44,905 --> 00:25:47,905
But if those who enforce it cannot distinguish
good from evil or right from wrong,

519
00:25:47,985 --> 00:25:49,865
then the law is nothing but wastepaper.

520
00:25:50,545 --> 00:25:51,625
How can that be called justice?

521
00:25:52,505 --> 00:25:53,785
Meng Tinghui.

522
00:25:53,865 --> 00:25:55,665
Do you think killing a few lackeys

523
00:25:55,745 --> 00:25:57,505
will rescue the people from their suffering?

524
00:25:58,785 --> 00:25:59,625
Do you know

525
00:25:59,705 --> 00:26:01,985
where the Tiger Roar Gang's stronghold is?

526
00:26:02,065 --> 00:26:04,665
How deeply its power has
infiltrated the Six Ministries?

527
00:26:04,745 --> 00:26:06,345
Or who supports it from behind?

528
00:26:07,225 --> 00:26:09,265
If we cannot uproot them completely,

529
00:26:09,345 --> 00:26:11,305
even more people will suffer.

530
00:26:12,665 --> 00:26:13,905
Saving thousands is still saving lives.

531
00:26:15,385 --> 00:26:16,465
Does saving a single person

532
00:26:17,225 --> 00:26:18,465
somehow cease to be saving a life?

533
00:26:19,225 --> 00:26:21,385
I do not possess Your
Majesty's far-reaching vision.

534
00:26:22,225 --> 00:26:24,545
I crawled out from a pile of corpses

535
00:26:25,945 --> 00:26:26,985
and grew up on the streets.

536
00:26:28,225 --> 00:26:30,665
I have seen too many lives
treated as worthless weeds.

537
00:26:30,745 --> 00:26:32,225
When evil stands before you,

538
00:26:32,825 --> 00:26:34,825
life and death can be decided in an instant.

539
00:26:35,545 --> 00:26:37,665
Had I not acted decisively yesterday,

540
00:26:37,745 --> 00:26:38,945
A-Cheng and his wife

541
00:26:39,025 --> 00:26:41,705
would now be two corpses in an unmarked grave.

542
00:26:42,665 --> 00:26:44,505
Had Your Majesty seen it with your own eyes,

543
00:26:44,585 --> 00:26:46,225
seen those villains pin the
people in pools of blood

544
00:26:46,305 --> 00:26:47,185
and manhandle and humiliate them,

545
00:26:48,265 --> 00:26:49,865
you certainly would not have stood by.

546
00:26:51,265 --> 00:26:53,065
Would Your Majesty not wish to personally

547
00:26:53,145 --> 00:26:55,745
cut those who torment the
people into a thousand pieces?

548
00:27:07,865 --> 00:27:09,265
Do you dare claim you had no selfish motive?

549
00:27:09,345 --> 00:27:11,345
You abused your authority.

550
00:27:11,425 --> 00:27:13,305
Do you take my trust as a game?

551
00:27:15,945 --> 00:27:17,665
You have disappointed me greatly.

552
00:27:19,825 --> 00:27:20,985
Your Majesty.

553
00:27:21,065 --> 00:27:23,705
Was the Bureau not created to punish
corruption and eradicate evil?

554
00:27:23,785 --> 00:27:25,585
Why does Your Majesty
demand the law's protection

555
00:27:25,665 --> 00:27:27,265
for those executioners?

556
00:27:27,945 --> 00:27:29,465
The law belongs to the people.

557
00:27:30,145 --> 00:27:31,185
Before becoming an official,

558
00:27:31,265 --> 00:27:32,505
I too was a citizen of Great Ning.

559
00:27:32,585 --> 00:27:34,985
The law should stand behind the weak,

560
00:27:35,705 --> 00:27:37,425
not prolong the lives of
those who deserve death.

561
00:27:38,545 --> 00:27:40,425
Is the Bureau merely an
ornament Your Majesty created

562
00:27:40,505 --> 00:27:41,505
to decorate an illusion of peace

563
00:27:42,105 --> 00:27:44,425
and display the image of a wise ruler?

564
00:27:50,465 --> 00:27:52,305
Our superior has gone mad.

565
00:27:52,385 --> 00:27:53,665
That is practically treasonous.

566
00:27:54,265 --> 00:27:55,945
No one has ever dared show
His Majesty such disrespect.

567
00:28:00,305 --> 00:28:02,145
You rely on my favor

568
00:28:02,225 --> 00:28:03,825
to act recklessly,

569
00:28:03,905 --> 00:28:04,985
and you refuse to repent.

570
00:28:07,825 --> 00:28:09,345
Then let me ask you,

571
00:28:09,905 --> 00:28:12,385
what do you take me and the Bureau for?

572
00:28:13,145 --> 00:28:14,185
Your chess pieces,

573
00:28:14,945 --> 00:28:16,465
to manipulate as you please?

574
00:28:17,745 --> 00:28:18,585
Favor?

575
00:28:22,305 --> 00:28:24,345
Between Your Majesty and me,

576
00:28:24,425 --> 00:28:27,025
have we not always been using each other?

577
00:28:27,105 --> 00:28:29,105
Your Majesty is the one who wields the sword,

578
00:28:29,745 --> 00:28:31,945
yet you could not find a suitable blade.

579
00:28:32,025 --> 00:28:33,905
So you settled for second best

580
00:28:34,945 --> 00:28:36,465
and chose me,

581
00:28:36,545 --> 00:28:39,185
a blunt knife that cannot
even be called a sword.

582
00:28:39,265 --> 00:28:40,265
If Your Majesty's favor

583
00:28:40,345 --> 00:28:41,825
means allowing villains to roam free,

584
00:28:42,665 --> 00:28:44,025
turning the law into a joke,

585
00:28:44,105 --> 00:28:46,305
and leaving the people's grievances unheard,

586
00:28:46,385 --> 00:28:47,545
then such favor

587
00:28:51,025 --> 00:28:51,905
means nothing to me.

588
00:28:53,345 --> 00:28:54,745
I would rather be a broken blade

589
00:28:55,505 --> 00:28:57,065
and keep my conscience clear.

590
00:28:57,145 --> 00:28:58,865
A clear conscience?

591
00:29:00,345 --> 00:29:02,305
Do you know that in this court,

592
00:29:03,185 --> 00:29:05,145
those with clear consciences die the fastest?

593
00:29:05,225 --> 00:29:06,465
Then I will be the first.

594
00:29:08,345 --> 00:29:10,225
I am unworthy of the position
of Director of the Bureau,

595
00:29:10,305 --> 00:29:11,665
and I no longer dare

596
00:29:11,745 --> 00:29:12,905
to retain it.

597
00:29:21,145 --> 00:29:22,865
Your Majesty, although Official Meng was wrong,

598
00:29:22,945 --> 00:29:24,785
she did punish those wicked corpse thieves

599
00:29:24,865 --> 00:29:26,785
and made the Bureau's name known.

600
00:29:26,865 --> 00:29:28,385
Many people have already come today

601
00:29:28,465 --> 00:29:29,705
to voluntarily submit their grievances.

602
00:29:29,785 --> 00:29:31,585
Removing Official Meng at this moment

603
00:29:31,665 --> 00:29:32,745
may be inappropriate.

604
00:29:32,825 --> 00:29:34,705
I have not yet held you accountable,

605
00:29:35,665 --> 00:29:37,425
yet you are already pleading for her.

606
00:29:37,905 --> 00:29:39,745
She acted rashly and impulsively.

607
00:29:39,825 --> 00:29:41,745
Should you not have advised and restrained her?

608
00:29:43,145 --> 00:29:43,985
I acknowledge my guilt.

609
00:29:44,065 --> 00:29:45,065
Your Majesty.

610
00:29:45,585 --> 00:29:47,705
The Divine Guard failed to
stop Official Meng in time.

611
00:29:47,785 --> 00:29:49,705
I bear responsibility that cannot be avoided.

612
00:29:49,785 --> 00:29:51,625
Assistant Shen alone cannot be blamed.

613
00:29:51,705 --> 00:29:52,865
Your Majesty.

614
00:29:52,945 --> 00:29:54,425
Official Meng spoke recklessly
in the heat of the moment.

615
00:29:55,145 --> 00:29:56,665
She did not intend to anger Your Majesty.

616
00:29:56,745 --> 00:29:58,305
Please calm your anger.

617
00:30:04,585 --> 00:30:06,185
And what exactly are you?

618
00:30:06,825 --> 00:30:08,465
Who gave you the right to interrupt here?

619
00:30:08,545 --> 00:30:10,225
He truly is no decent thing.

620
00:30:10,305 --> 00:30:11,705
He poisoned me the moment he arrived.

621
00:30:11,785 --> 00:30:13,545
Yin Qing is a colleague of mine at the Bureau.

622
00:30:14,305 --> 00:30:16,865
Is your Bureau a place for
recruiting pretty-faced young men?

623
00:30:16,945 --> 00:30:18,465
Your Majesty's words

624
00:30:18,545 --> 00:30:20,505
are a grave insult to me.

625
00:30:20,585 --> 00:30:22,345
Yin Qing is the Bureau's know-it-all.

626
00:30:22,985 --> 00:30:25,425
He contributed greatly to
capturing the corpse thieves.

627
00:30:26,505 --> 00:30:27,745
If Your Majesty is dissatisfied with me,

628
00:30:28,745 --> 00:30:30,065
then punish me alone.

629
00:30:30,705 --> 00:30:31,865
There is no need to vent
your anger on everyone else.

630
00:30:34,065 --> 00:30:35,225
Starting immediately,

631
00:30:35,745 --> 00:30:37,265
Meng Tinghui will move out of this residence.

632
00:31:10,985 --> 00:31:12,025
Official.

633
00:31:12,745 --> 00:31:14,345
His Majesty is furious right now.

634
00:31:15,505 --> 00:31:17,145
Perhaps you should yield for the moment,

635
00:31:17,225 --> 00:31:18,945
wait until His Majesty has calmed down,

636
00:31:19,025 --> 00:31:20,265
and then decide what to do.

637
00:31:21,105 --> 00:31:21,985
His Majesty's oral decree.

638
00:31:23,665 --> 00:31:26,305
Meng Tinghui acted impulsively and
showed disrespect to His Majesty.

639
00:31:27,065 --> 00:31:28,305
She is to be imprisoned immediately
in the Ministry of Justice jail

640
00:31:28,385 --> 00:31:29,905
and await judgment.

641
00:31:29,985 --> 00:31:31,985
Official Meng was wrong, but
she acted for the people.

642
00:31:32,065 --> 00:31:33,105
Please reconsider, Your Majesty.

643
00:31:33,185 --> 00:31:34,705
His Majesty's order has already been issued.

644
00:31:34,785 --> 00:31:36,225
We are merely carrying it out.

645
00:31:37,705 --> 00:31:38,825
Official Meng, please cooperate.

646
00:31:38,905 --> 00:31:39,745
But...

647
00:31:40,545 --> 00:31:41,425
Say no more.

648
00:31:43,025 --> 00:31:44,065
I will go with you.

649
00:32:24,225 --> 00:32:25,665
I said long ago

650
00:32:26,785 --> 00:32:28,545
that women cannot shoulder
great responsibilities.

651
00:32:29,825 --> 00:32:31,025
Just look.

652
00:32:31,105 --> 00:32:32,785
She has held office for only a few days,

653
00:32:33,705 --> 00:32:35,905
yet already caused such disaster.

654
00:32:35,985 --> 00:32:38,665
His Majesty always complains that
the Left Chancellor meddles too much.

655
00:32:38,745 --> 00:32:40,065
But the moment the Chancellor lets go,

656
00:32:40,585 --> 00:32:42,505
such enormous chaos erupts.

657
00:32:42,585 --> 00:32:45,105
The Left Chancellor truly
sees farther than others.

658
00:32:45,185 --> 00:32:46,265
Since when has the capital's course

659
00:32:46,345 --> 00:32:48,105
been steered by women?

660
00:32:48,705 --> 00:32:50,545
Meng Tinghui alone is nothing to fear.

661
00:32:50,625 --> 00:32:53,185
But that woman is full of schemes.

662
00:32:54,065 --> 00:32:55,425
If she remains in the capital,

663
00:32:55,985 --> 00:32:57,625
she will become a threat sooner or later.

664
00:32:57,705 --> 00:32:58,945
We must use this opportunity

665
00:33:00,305 --> 00:33:01,745
to drive her out of the capital,

666
00:33:02,825 --> 00:33:04,825
as far from His Majesty as possible.

667
00:33:06,105 --> 00:33:07,425
I understand.

668
00:33:14,225 --> 00:33:15,185
Is it good?

669
00:33:15,265 --> 00:33:17,385
It is. Thank you, Brother.

670
00:33:20,145 --> 00:33:21,105
Gang Leader.

671
00:33:24,905 --> 00:33:26,185
Come, Yangyang and Xiaobo.

672
00:33:26,265 --> 00:33:28,025
Take your younger brothers
and sisters upstairs to eat.

673
00:33:28,105 --> 00:33:28,945
All right.

674
00:33:36,785 --> 00:33:37,625
Speak.

675
00:33:38,545 --> 00:33:39,385
Second Brother...

676
00:33:40,625 --> 00:33:41,465
is dead.

677
00:33:42,545 --> 00:33:44,705
It was Meng Tinghui of the Bureau.

678
00:33:46,425 --> 00:33:48,225
She told me to relay a message to you.

679
00:33:48,305 --> 00:33:50,345
She said not to hide like a turtle.

680
00:33:50,425 --> 00:33:51,345
She said

681
00:33:51,425 --> 00:33:53,025
that as long as she remains at the Bureau,

682
00:33:53,105 --> 00:33:54,545
the Tiger Roar Gang

683
00:33:54,625 --> 00:33:56,065
will never know peace.

684
00:34:07,345 --> 00:34:10,265
I despise brainless trash most of all.

685
00:34:14,545 --> 00:34:15,905
Lü Er is dead.

686
00:34:15,985 --> 00:34:17,105
You may join him.

687
00:34:17,185 --> 00:34:18,025
No...

688
00:34:21,865 --> 00:34:23,625
I warned Lü Er long ago

689
00:34:23,705 --> 00:34:26,025
not to cause trouble during this period.

690
00:34:26,105 --> 00:34:28,425
Second Brother only acted because
he ruined the last assignment

691
00:34:28,505 --> 00:34:29,385
and was desperate to earn merit.

692
00:34:29,465 --> 00:34:31,025
That is why he caused another disaster.

693
00:34:31,105 --> 00:34:32,665
I will take several brothers right now

694
00:34:32,745 --> 00:34:33,905
and before dawn,

695
00:34:33,985 --> 00:34:35,585
bring that wench's head before you.

696
00:34:36,265 --> 00:34:37,505
Do you intend to die as well?

697
00:34:44,545 --> 00:34:45,785
Gang Leader.

698
00:34:45,865 --> 00:34:47,705
Second Brother followed you for so many years,

699
00:34:47,785 --> 00:34:49,385
through wind and rain.

700
00:34:49,465 --> 00:34:51,265
Even without great achievements,
he worked hard for us.

701
00:34:51,345 --> 00:34:53,705
If we simply let Meng Tinghui go,

702
00:34:54,385 --> 00:34:57,185
he will not rest in peace
even in the underworld.

703
00:35:08,105 --> 00:35:10,145
Meng Tinghui dared touch one of my men.

704
00:35:10,225 --> 00:35:12,545
I will make her pay a hundredfold.

705
00:35:12,625 --> 00:35:14,145
Thank you, Gang Leader.

706
00:35:14,625 --> 00:35:16,305
As long as I can avenge Second Brother,

707
00:35:17,065 --> 00:35:19,145
I will climb mountains of
blades and cross seas of fire

708
00:35:19,225 --> 00:35:20,225
without hesitation.

709
00:35:28,865 --> 00:35:30,985
What could not be explained in a letter

710
00:35:31,065 --> 00:35:32,185
that required us to meet?

711
00:35:33,785 --> 00:35:35,585
That newly appointed Meng Tinghui

712
00:35:36,825 --> 00:35:38,665
caused the death of my trusted brother.

713
00:35:39,905 --> 00:35:42,105
I want to torture her to
death with my own hands.

714
00:35:42,185 --> 00:35:43,625
His Majesty established the Bureau

715
00:35:43,705 --> 00:35:45,385
specifically to investigate the Tiger Roar Gang.

716
00:35:45,465 --> 00:35:47,385
Do you still not understand the gravity of this?

717
00:35:48,185 --> 00:35:50,745
He was merely an insignificant subordinate.

718
00:35:50,825 --> 00:35:52,225
Do not make this matter any bigger.

719
00:35:52,305 --> 00:35:53,665
Insignificant?

720
00:35:54,185 --> 00:35:55,345
Had I been heartless,

721
00:35:56,145 --> 00:35:57,745
how would you have reached your position today?

722
00:36:06,025 --> 00:36:07,505
What exactly are you afraid of?

723
00:36:08,305 --> 00:36:10,225
She is merely a woman,

724
00:36:10,305 --> 00:36:11,745
abandoned by His Majesty

725
00:36:11,825 --> 00:36:13,905
and now reduced to a prisoner.

726
00:36:14,905 --> 00:36:15,985
If you will do nothing,

727
00:36:17,345 --> 00:36:19,025
I will go to the Ministry of Justice myself.

728
00:36:21,105 --> 00:36:22,385
Stop.

729
00:36:26,385 --> 00:36:29,025
If our dealings are exposed,

730
00:36:29,105 --> 00:36:31,265
it will be a crime punishable
by the execution of nine clans.

731
00:36:31,345 --> 00:36:32,505
All the better.

732
00:36:32,585 --> 00:36:35,265
You and I can travel the final road together,

733
00:36:35,345 --> 00:36:36,865
and keep each other company
on the path to the underworld.

734
00:36:36,945 --> 00:36:37,785
Silence!

735
00:36:38,705 --> 00:36:39,545
Elder Brother.

736
00:36:40,905 --> 00:36:42,025
You are far too naive.

737
00:36:42,825 --> 00:36:45,425
From the first day you took that position,

738
00:36:45,505 --> 00:36:47,745
we were already in the same boat.

739
00:36:49,865 --> 00:36:51,425
You wish to get off now?

740
00:36:52,785 --> 00:36:53,905
It is too late.

741
00:36:55,705 --> 00:36:57,305
I can hand her over to you,

742
00:36:58,065 --> 00:36:59,745
but you must act decisively

743
00:37:00,505 --> 00:37:01,985
and leave no one alive.

744
00:37:02,065 --> 00:37:04,785
Then I will await your good news, Elder Brother.

745
00:37:13,585 --> 00:37:14,465
Miss Yan.

746
00:37:21,985 --> 00:37:22,825
Young Master Shen.

747
00:37:22,905 --> 00:37:24,545
I originally came to find Assistant Shen.

748
00:37:24,625 --> 00:37:25,545
Meeting you is even better.

749
00:37:25,625 --> 00:37:27,105
You are close to His Majesty.

750
00:37:27,185 --> 00:37:29,185
Could you plead with him to release Mengmeng?

751
00:37:29,265 --> 00:37:31,345
I cannot help you with this.

752
00:38:01,865 --> 00:38:03,145
Assistant Shen!

753
00:38:03,865 --> 00:38:04,865
Assistant Shen!

754
00:38:04,945 --> 00:38:06,305
Do not waste your effort.

755
00:38:06,385 --> 00:38:07,225
I came today

756
00:38:07,305 --> 00:38:08,905
to take Zhili back to the residence

757
00:38:09,705 --> 00:38:10,865
and stop her from interfering in this matter.

758
00:38:13,265 --> 00:38:15,425
It is bad enough that you
stand by and do nothing.

759
00:38:15,505 --> 00:38:16,985
Why must you also stop Assistant Shen?

760
00:38:17,065 --> 00:38:18,745
Mengmeng merely killed a few
people who deserved death.

761
00:38:18,825 --> 00:38:19,665
What did she do wrong?

762
00:38:21,305 --> 00:38:22,665
Your way of thinking and Meng Tinghui's

763
00:38:22,745 --> 00:38:23,945
truly are exactly alike.

764
00:38:24,025 --> 00:38:25,425
No wonder you became friends.

765
00:38:26,545 --> 00:38:28,185
You and His Majesty are alike as well,

766
00:38:28,265 --> 00:38:29,185
cold and heartless.

767
00:38:29,265 --> 00:38:31,545
One moment he showers her with favor
and brings her into the palace,

768
00:38:31,625 --> 00:38:33,825
the next he turns on her
and throws her into prison.

769
00:38:33,905 --> 00:38:35,905
Such capricious moods and unpredictable temper

770
00:38:35,985 --> 00:38:36,865
are truly chilling.

771
00:38:36,945 --> 00:38:38,385
You dare speak wildly against His Majesty?

772
00:38:38,465 --> 00:38:40,105
His Majesty has his own considerations.

773
00:38:40,185 --> 00:38:41,185
It is not your place to criticize him.

774
00:38:42,105 --> 00:38:44,225
If it is not my place, what about you?

775
00:38:44,305 --> 00:38:46,225
You are merely a spoiled rake
relying on His Majesty's favor.

776
00:38:46,305 --> 00:38:47,865
What right do you have to shout at me?

777
00:38:47,945 --> 00:38:49,865
Who exactly is shouting?

778
00:38:49,945 --> 00:38:51,545
You truly know how to turn
the accusation around.

779
00:38:52,185 --> 00:38:53,025
You are.

780
00:38:53,665 --> 00:38:55,425
You are the one shouting at me.

781
00:38:55,505 --> 00:38:56,785
Young Master Shen.

782
00:39:03,785 --> 00:39:05,065
Why have you started arguing?

783
00:39:06,345 --> 00:39:07,305
And who is this young lady?

784
00:39:08,385 --> 00:39:09,745
My name is Yan Fuzhi.

785
00:39:09,825 --> 00:39:11,865
You must be Yin Qing, whom
Mengmeng often mentions.

786
00:39:12,745 --> 00:39:13,705
Where is Assistant Shen?

787
00:39:13,785 --> 00:39:14,825
Mengmeng has been imprisoned.

788
00:39:14,905 --> 00:39:16,545
I wanted to ask her to help me
enter the palace and see His Majesty

789
00:39:16,625 --> 00:39:17,505
so she could plead for Mengmeng.

790
00:39:17,585 --> 00:39:18,825
Assistant Shen spent the entire night preparing

791
00:39:18,905 --> 00:39:20,185
twenty charges against the Tiger Roar Gang

792
00:39:20,265 --> 00:39:21,105
and submitted them to His Majesty.

793
00:39:21,185 --> 00:39:23,625
She also asked the Right Chancellor to
submit a memorial pleading for mercy.

794
00:39:23,705 --> 00:39:24,905
But His Majesty

795
00:39:25,465 --> 00:39:27,425
-has not relented.
-Then I will go myself.

796
00:39:27,505 --> 00:39:29,225
I will personally kowtow and
apologize to His Majesty.

797
00:39:29,945 --> 00:39:31,185
I must see Mengmeng.

798
00:39:31,265 --> 00:39:32,185
Miss Yan.

799
00:39:33,145 --> 00:39:34,265
Wait here for me a moment.

800
00:39:34,345 --> 00:39:35,185
All right.

801
00:39:38,025 --> 00:39:40,105
Do you think His Majesty cares
about your kowtowing apology?

802
00:39:40,185 --> 00:39:41,985
His Majesty cares about you. You
should go kowtow and apologize.

803
00:39:42,065 --> 00:39:43,425
Why should I kowtow and apologize?

804
00:39:43,505 --> 00:39:44,625
What does this have to do with me?

805
00:39:44,705 --> 00:39:46,465
-You...
-Stop arguing.

806
00:39:48,705 --> 00:39:51,625
The most important thing now
is to rescue Official Meng.

807
00:39:51,705 --> 00:39:53,665
Brother, the one who tied
the knot must untie it.

808
00:39:53,745 --> 00:39:55,345
We want to see Official Meng.

809
00:39:57,985 --> 00:39:58,825
This matter...

810
00:39:59,865 --> 00:40:01,065
Young Master Shen.

811
00:40:01,145 --> 00:40:03,185
Mengmeng is now imprisoned in
the Ministry of Justice jail.

812
00:40:04,105 --> 00:40:05,745
I fear they may use unlawful torture on her.

813
00:40:06,585 --> 00:40:07,425
I am begging you.

814
00:40:08,025 --> 00:40:08,865
Please help me.

815
00:40:09,425 --> 00:40:10,625
Let me go see her.

816
00:40:10,705 --> 00:40:11,865
His Majesty has already ordered

817
00:40:12,385 --> 00:40:13,985
that no one may visit her.

818
00:40:16,865 --> 00:40:18,825
Mengmeng, you poor thing.

819
00:40:21,105 --> 00:40:22,665
You clearly rendered great service,

820
00:40:22,745 --> 00:40:25,185
yet you are still locked in prison,

821
00:40:25,265 --> 00:40:26,385
without enough to eat,

822
00:40:26,465 --> 00:40:27,385
without warm clothes,

823
00:40:27,465 --> 00:40:28,905
and subjected to torture.

824
00:40:30,745 --> 00:40:32,865
No one is even helping you.

825
00:40:32,945 --> 00:40:34,225
-Enough.
-What are we going to do?

826
00:40:35,105 --> 00:40:35,985
Enough.

827
00:40:37,465 --> 00:40:38,425
Stop crying.

828
00:40:38,505 --> 00:40:39,425
I will arrange it.

829
00:40:40,185 --> 00:40:41,305
Really?

